description:
List the files and folders inside a folder of your Nekoweb site, sorted by path.

Set recursive=true to walk subfolders too (up to max_depth levels; each subfolder costs one API request against the rate limit, capped at 25 per call). Results are paginated with limit/offset.

Examples:
  - "What's on my site?" -> { path: "/" }
  - "Find every image on my site" -> { path: "/mysite.nekoweb.org/assets", recursive: true }
